   "`v{VERSION}_r###`",
   "v1.7_r001",
   "`v{VERSION}_Release`",
   "`v{VERSION}_r###_description.py`",
   "the folder that holds `cartulary-src/`",
   "v1.6.1",
   "r052",
   "session 20",
   "stage every file in its scope",
   "stop hook",
   "every load",
   "Judge stored data by the rules that produced it",
   "A user's world carries every upgrade it has been through",
   "A migration that retires something other records point at by id",
   "The control decides how far a defect reaches",
   "A new screen gets looked at before it's staged",
   "A fork that says what the app does is checked against the app",
   "A field list's real review is the first use of the form it draws",
   "A screenshot is read for what the screen says",
   "A probe reads the saved world only after the save has run",
   "An older probe that stops at a check the cut changed on purpose",
   "A control that can't get past its first check",
   "The same values shown in two places come in the same order",
   "A flag added to a stored record has to come through every pass that writes the record",
   "A census of what reads a field is taken from the code",
   "A refactor that keeps behavior but not bytes is proven by recording the behavior",
   "A check whose result changes under load has found a race",
   "A planted defect that crashes the probe has been noticed, not counted",
   "A planted copy that passes every check has either found a blind check or a world that never reaches the rule",
   "A queued run whose check count differs from the solo run's is the race too",
   "A backlog row filed for the next cut that touches a file is read at the plan of every cut that touches it"
  ],
